/zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-ii/chapter-4#24-11\" data-permitext-zr-source=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-ii/chapter-4#24-11\"><span>24-11</span></a> (Maximum Floor Area Ratio and Percentage of Lot Coverage).</li>\n</ol>","plainText":"In R6 through R12 Districts with a letter suffix, the maximum floor area ratio on a zoning lot for philanthropic or non-profit institutions with sleeping accommodations shall be as set forth in Section 24-11 (Maximum Floor Area Ratio and Percentage of Lot Coverage)."}],"zoning":{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceNodeID":17633,"sourcePath":"/article-ii/chapter-4/24-111","sourceURL":"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-ii/chapter-4/24-111","sourceContentHash":"f8d351506c1ad05ec3d1fdb37762d289ef2f7b63eddb8ee10318ea8cb35ee43b","article":{"roman":"II","title":"Residence District Regulations"},"chapter":{"number":"4","title":"Bulk Regulations for Community Facilities in Residence Districts","canonicalNumber":"II-4"},"appendix":null,"subsections":[{"id":"zr-17633-sub-d94d2bb3309ea749","label":"0.50","sourceAnchor":null,"plainText":"0.50","ordinal":0},{"id":"zr-17633-sub-a5c27fdcedadabca","label":"0.75","sourceAnchor":null,"plainText":"0.75","ordinal":1},{"id":"zr-17633-sub-d41d1c1625b217c4","label":"1.27","sourceAnchor":null,"plainText":"1.27","ordinal":2},{"id":"zr-17633-sub-639e142c5881aa9d","label":"2.00","sourceAnchor":null,"plainText":"2.00","ordinal":3},{"id":"zr-17633-sub-a56010a9b6307efe","label":"2.43","sourceAnchor":null,"plainText":"2.43","ordinal":4},{"id":"zr-17633-sub-e4398ae5fc1c6f21","label":"3.44","sourceAnchor":null,"plainText":"3.44","ordinal":5},{"id":"zr-17633-sub-611bce9fb5d11229","label":"6.02","sourceAnchor":null,"plainText":"6.02","ordinal":6},{"id":"zr-17633-sub-89e4629ad6022016","label":"7.52","sourceAnchor":null,"plainText":"7.52","ordinal":7}],"tables":[{"id":"zr-17633-table-001","ordinal":0,"sourceAnchor":null,"caption":null,"plainText":"District Maximum Floor Area Ratio Permitted R3 0.50 R4 0.75 R5 R5A R5B 1.27 R5